out.push(S('Stage 7P · Respond (sample slip — criterion named)'));
out.push(A('_Three sentences, each naming its criterion:_ **"On the approximators: every figure has one and the range has its mean, and the three words _nine weekdays and two Saturdays_ are what make the eleven worth having. On the _out of_: four hundred out of four hundred and fifty-six puts the fault inside the figure, and it is the only version of this page anybody could act on. On what you are not claiming: _it would be smaller_ is the sentence that makes me believe the rest, and I would not change a word of that paragraph."**'));
out.push(S('Stage 7R · Share'));
out.push(A('It is most of the room, and say why it is not carelessness: **a total is the figure you happen to know; a proportion is the figure you have to go and get.** Then put the price on the board — eleven mornings at a bus stop, twenty seconds at the end of nine shifts — and make the point that this is the cheapest research any of them will ever do and the only research most of them will ever be in a position to do themselves. The homework begins the count **today**, which is the operative word in the rubric: a count that begins on Monday begins in February.'));
